# This rule NEVER MATCHED and the artwork has been in git the whole time.
# The folder was renamed to " EXERCISE LIBRARY", with a space in front to sort
# it to the top of Finder, and a gitignore pattern is literal about that space.
# On 25 Aug 2026 it moved again, into " EXERCISE DATABASE/ EXERCISE PHOTO
# LIBRARY", where the pictures sit beside the movements they illustrate.
#
# It is left here, matching nothing, as the honest record: roughly 160 MB of
# source artwork IS tracked, which is most of the size of this repo. Taking it
# out is a real decision with a real cost - the pictures would then live only
# in Dropbox - so it is Nicolas's to make, not something to do quietly.
